.TH maw-host 1  "maw-host " 
.SH NAME
maw\-host \- show or set this machine\*(Aqs name, which picks its hosts/<name>.nix and own packages
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmaw host\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
