show or set this machine\*(Aqs name, which picks its hosts/<name>.nix and own packages
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
a new name for this machine
.SH EXTRA
see: maw help more than one machine
